  "methodNotes": [
    "HTTP cache disabled; isolated Chrome 152 on Apple M1/ANGLE Metal; unthrottled local HTTP; 1440x1000 at device pixel ratio 1. Driver shader caches were not reset between runs.",
    "Continuous-view samples use a one-microradian yaw change per RAF to force genuine redraws; idle is sampled separately.",
    "Driving holds W for 240 RAF intervals; wall time and distance vary with frame rate, so this is a streaming stress comparison, not an identical timed route.",
    "A frame includes all composer and shadow passes; draw/triangle counters are reset before the whole composer render. CPU submission times are not GPU timings.",
    "First-frame time marks render submission, not pixels presented. Settled time includes polling and a fixed 1.8-second allowance; network transfer counts are for reconstruction assets only."
  ]
